      "id": "claim_3a18bd4165b446c1a63389e16219e006",
      "statement": "fetchArdocoApi builds a multipart POST to /api/{api_name lowercased}/start — or /api/find-inconsistencies/start, which is restricted to the SAD_SAM (SWATTR) pipeline — validates that each pipeline's required files are present, appends projectName and the empty-filtered additionalConfigs JSON, and returns {jsonResult, usedFiles}, throwing unless the response contains a requestId.",
