    {
      "id": "claim_ae6e311514c2478296f1e38c1e7604a4",
      "statement": "MultiStepFormNewProject implements the four-step create wizard (Upload Files, Project Details, Configuration, Summary) where each step carries a FormValidation-backed validation() that gates progression, the summary step re-validates the earlier steps and disables the Calculate TraceLinks button while errors exist, and on final submit it calls fetchArdocoApi, stores the uploaded files in browser OPFS keyed by the returned requestId, and redirects to /view/{encodedId}?type=...&inconsistencies=...; an API failure opens a modal offering retry or a view-provided fallback.",
      "evidence": [
